<title>USA: BTG Inc wins U.S. intelligence contract.</title>
<headline>BTG Inc wins U.S. intelligence contract.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTG Inc said on Tuesday that it was selected to provide information technology hardware for the U.S. intelligence community.</p>
<p>Terms of the Systems Acquisition Support Services Hardware II contract were not released by the issuing agency, but BTG was awarded five of the contract's six areas. It had not competed for the sixth, the company said.</p>
<p>The contract is meant to improve the delivery of intelligent information, reduce duplication, ensure interoperability among intelligence agencies and examine concepts for future integration, BTG said.</p>
</text>
